<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-Ireland's Abbey yr pre-tax rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ireland's Abbey yr pre-tax rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.76		  vs 11.17</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.6		    vs 3.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.8		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    9.11		   vs 6.22</p>
<p> Turnover		   61.78		  vs 44.95</p>
<p> Operating profit	 8.49		   vs 5.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Abbey Plc is an Irish-based property and development group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779  </p>
<p>It said that prospects for the year ahead are bright.</p>
<p>&quot;We are planning for increased turnover and profit in all our activities. These expectations are consistent with trading since the year end,&quot; Abbey said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
